easywall (2.7.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: nftables forgets every rule on a restart, and nothing put them back —
    a reboot left the machine unfiltered until somebody opened the web
    interface and pressed Apply. The core now restores the stored rule set
    into the kernel before its socket accepts a single connection, with no
